name iso-639-3
# ISO 639-3's tables: every row says of its identifier what each column holds, under the column's own name.
match iso-639-3.tab iso-639-3_Name_Index.tab iso-639-3_Retirements.tab
grammar table
header
# The tables do not name who publishes them; the pages kept beside them in sil/ are signed "Copyright © 2026 SIL Global".
witness SIL Global

claims
subject in Id
attest *
